\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We have $7\\in [a]_{6}$ if \n\n$$\n7≡a\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6).\n$$\n\nLet's now consider each of the given equivalence classes.\n\n- $7\\in [-5]_{6}$ because $7≡-5\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $7\\notin [3]_{6}$ because $7≢3\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6)$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- $7\\in [1]_{6}$ because $7≡1\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6)$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412966 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152098 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9c1fe7ea-d91e-5440-b756-37a460a18f19" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Residue Classes Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e6e7c1fd-c51f-58f5-ab67-eb7ce0f07759" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473500} {:answer/id #uuid "efec4b84-7421-5a5d-8924-41a32849ead2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473501}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "efec4b84-7421-5a5d-8924-41a32849ead2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473501} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ee3dee7-dffd-54e2-99a6-8707d0ba2ceb" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474145} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d5781406-d904-5fd5-b8e7-a4a4c1368ead" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473502} {:answer/id #uuid "4b170e3a-9a05-5cc0-8d8e-61dfed0e05a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473503}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4b170e3a-9a05-5cc0-8d8e-61dfed0e05a6" :answer/type {:db/