9]_{13} & =\\{x\\in Z\\,|\\,x≡9\\,(\\text{mod}\\,13)\\} \\\\  & =\\{x\\in Z\\,|\\,x=9+13k,\\,k\\in Z\\} \\\\  & =\\{9+13k\\,|\\,k\\in Z\\} \\\\  & =\\{…,\\,9-2\\cdot 13,\\,9-13,\\,9,\\,9+13,\\,9+2\\cdot 13,\\,…\\} \\\\  & =\\{…,-17,-4,9,22,35,…\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe see that $-17$ and $35$ belong to $[9]_{13},$ while $4$ does not.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412972 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152097 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d2f207a-8e99-5520-ab9f-266c8f54465b" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Elements Belonging to a Residue Class"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "baa998ac-54ca-5267-9f36-626df9555629" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473386} {:answer/id #uuid "f4a58b13-d4de-5cdf-9034-b6b7eeab793f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473387}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4a58b13-d4de-5cdf-9034-b6b7eeab793f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473387} :answer-field/id #uuid "fc0dd59d-867c-5f60-96f5-ff258ea1b79c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474088} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d73de0d-4115-5a34-841b-04b6e4cf2e23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473388} {:answer/id #uuid "ef4b3724-8c13-505f-99c3-d073c7fd73c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473389}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1d73de0d-4115-5a34-841b-04b6e4cf2e23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473388} :answer-field/id #uuid "274b931b-669b-5714-ac89-ae09e0a1bb48" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474089} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "90f31dbd-3161-57f6-a8fa-37cec703fe4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473390} {:answer/id #uuid "fc230375-393b-59e9-881c-e1dc86f27d29" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473391}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "90f31dbd-3161-57f6-a8fa-37cec703fe4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473390} :answer-field/id #uuid "7a38ae81-8d40-5e8f-ad84-7cf8d41e0b85" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474090}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "abd84654-ac2d-58a6-9574-529f2b4aa6f5" :question/math-academy-id "q-78597" :question/problem "Which of the following integers belong to the residue class $[-7]_{11}?$\n\nI. $15$\n\nII. $-4$\n\nIII. $7$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "The residue class $[-7]_{11}$ consists of the elements that are congruent to $-7$ modulo $11.$ So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[-7]_{11} & =\\{x\\in Z\\,|\\,x≡-7\\,(\\text{mod}\\,11)\\} \\\\  & =\\{x\\in Z\\,|\\,x=-7+11k,\\,k\\in Z\\} \\\\  & =\\{-7+11k\\,|\\,k\\in Z\\} \\\\  & =\\{…,\\,-7-2\\cdot 11,\\,-7-11,\\,-7,\\,-7+11,\\,-7+2\\cdot 11,\\,…\\} \\\\  & =\\{…,-29,-18,-7,4,15,…\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe see that $15$ belongs to $[-7]_{11},$ while $-4$ and $7$ do not.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref